    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be a great detective? In <i>DETECTIVE \u2013 The Test</i>, you will face three intriguing cases where only your observation skills and logical thinking will lead you to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crime scenes, analyze the connections between the people involved, and answer key questions: Who is the victim? Who is the culprit? When did the crime take place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no easy clues or shortcuts, only you and your deduction skills. Take notes, connect the dots, and uncover the truth in three distinct locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caravan park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coffee shop hiding secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? The truth is waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic deduction experience with no hints or hand-holding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique cases, each with its own story and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe, analyze, and answer critical questions to crack the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive experience that challenges your logic and critical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for true fans of detective challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth, or will the mystery remain unsolved?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be a great detective? In <i>DETECTIVE \u2013 The Test</i>, you will face three intriguing cases where only your observation skills and logical thinking will lead you to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crime scenes, analyze the connections between the people involved, and answer key questions: Who is the victim? Who is the culprit? When did the crime take place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no easy clues or shortcuts, only you and your deduction skills. Take notes, connect the dots, and uncover the truth in three distinct locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A caravan park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coffee shop hiding secrets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? The truth is waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A realistic deduction experience with no hints or hand-holding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three unique cases, each with its own story and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe, analyze, and answer critical questions to crack the case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive experience that challenges your logic and critical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for true fans of detective challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth, or will the mystery remain unsolved?</p>",
    "short_description": "Test your detective instincts across three challenging cases. No hints, no help\u2014just you, your intuition, and your ability to piece together the truth. Can you solve the mystery?",
